[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15423.469, "timestamp": "04:17:03", "text": "在我的设备上使用。呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15426.229, "timestamp": "04:17:06", "text": "两千多美元。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15430.389, "timestamp": "04:17:10", "text": "别在下面告诉我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15433.91, "timestamp": "04:17:13", "text": "我的天哪，那都是过去的事了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15437.189, "timestamp": "04:17:17", "text": "2018年，我曾经在50万观众面前直播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15443.269, "timestamp": "04:17:23", "text": "东西。真是超级超级超级嗯嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15446.149, "timestamp": "04:17:26", "text": "模糊不清的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15448.07, "timestamp": "04:17:28", "text": "是的。我唯一一次同时尝试了这两种方法"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15456.429, "timestamp": "04:17:36", "text": "是的。这是单人游戏模式。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15459.59, "timestamp": "04:17:39", "text": "啊，你好，丁。欢迎来到直播间"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15462.95, "timestamp": "04:17:42", "text": "踢。你好。你好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15473.11, "timestamp": "04:17:53", "text": "哦，你被录取了。是的。所以，共有四个平台。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15475.59, "timestamp": "04:17:55", "text": "我本来应该上《比利比利》节目的，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15478.469, "timestamp": "04:17:58", "text": "我找到的那家代理机构帮助了我"}]